{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c539e45acff84c3191adb659be41ffdda3de576a1e06d104e595b14346e581d6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eadfad861df16fbd6958113a38374caabb85a5b21104b8d285ea60303569d35",
      "text": "日常Science",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66c525d925ce297a3e1ec173ed1695850bb8844cdbdd9e6f996ef6e043e71c9f",
      "text": "即使如今辞去了教师的工作，次郎依然热爱化学。\n制作人推荐他接下一份某科学杂志的工作。\n听完说明的次郎，给出的回答是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eadfad861df16fbd6958113a38374caabb85a5b21104b8d285ea60303569d35",
      "text": "日常Science",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58d12a5832ff94874a0ca6e0e5cafa95014d04cf4ca1c6a0c8263543307a8712",
      "text": "嚯嚯。\n唔——，原来如此啊，居然是这种思路吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b88747398b25d48040d5e411ca5148b9c4db2c795a17bdf1a3b9dd548c7fa671",
      "text": "（……次郎先生，看得很专注呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f56b9cf19489a242c9980db014c1f3ab77c7a0030d7cd3d79733ac6a55ee592a",
      "text": "您在看什么呢，次郎先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28f91d29d12104a74d7c28aecb942cf43209b1c9a8662e9aa01c6399850853eb",
      "text": "哇啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbbb90465751467ad3bb5b913d52c9dd507aeae69bbd5586bfee431c7df5ed36",
      "text": "吓我一跳，是●●●●プロデューサー酱啊。\n哈啊，感觉寿命都缩短了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93a52f9cf2763d8590de2000ec8e79811437413d3850cd513ed13e6cb95053e1",
      "text": "抱歉，吓到您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e9fc31779d67661601da17ac10110a1813135a675cc7911c760c8ca72ab90ec",
      "text": "我本来只是想轻松地打个招呼的。\n那本书，已经有趣到让您这么入迷了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4bece3663f22bcb1d87dc5347eb0bd66136b483d0d9c81a0df8c0e1722aa5cf",
      "text": "哎？啊——，不，谁知道呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b53fbac54536683851197eb4c09c459aecebaac27820c0b321121223fdd2ae7",
      "text": "还是这边的赛马报纸要有趣得多啦。\n发笔横财，小马儿加油呀，之类的。嘿嘿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11f561e7351c1416567a7260514a57539d86a529885d2fd3fcb108d30b89ad5a",
      "text": "（……嗯？赛马报纸的夹缝里，\n好像露出了什么纸张……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60e9e6500bef3419d6ebd719d1e60cbf4d44607f363757652ac949702ade278",
      "text": "（那是……某篇论文？\n看起来是用英语写的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81f896d7a3f5b7b64ad0c24951c02f85de57803ad721acc30e00c0da10f22af0",
      "text": "那个……●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n你找我有事才搭话的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbfafaf131581397d437d8a064807a329671c45ac9dd77beafbe868fc614839b",
      "text": "还是说，单纯只是\n随便打个招呼而已？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c30af063ba88be747e150f0052b02a50e7d30ef56784c58b70956aa23c143cd",
      "text": "啊，不好意思。其实也没什么要紧事。\n不介意的话，要不要一起吃蛋糕？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8e38344f5f3831c10edd20a14cf715c68db0d70a36b76d29192538e0d13d29d",
      "text": "蛋糕？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d98d87a247abc115a4603ecc2c28294143f72638e3e906dd3e927068e7ce7820",
      "text": "是的。刚才商谈的合作方\n给事务所送来了蛋糕当慰问品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:489c02deba2969d8c67d1f8632f9a80fb84df5cd09f8fd8130c83f83aa3a1007",
      "text": "正好到了点心时间，我们喝杯茶吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eecc9013be3c7830a87ab2bc69a029cdcd7313f7055d8a503aa9e3ff089732f",
      "text": "哦，不错嘛♪\n来事务所转转真是来对了，嘿嘿嘿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6461efa6baba1787012875c205b61dd4db5d3783d78242bb75722d53a82e1f",
      "text": "我去准备饮料，\n能麻烦您把蛋糕分装到盘子里吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:488efe9b8ea80038b672a0ef41bda02ac661f8bb524468bce4723ea16ea4953d",
      "text": "好嘞好嘞，收到啦。\n……哦，里面放了干冰呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04b10aa5cc7ec9050af020a8044bf8ccf4c3bbe4a7ab217d500869d9bf714cd1",
      "text": "（干冰啊，就这么扔掉的话\n总觉得有点可惜呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b39987d135609586ef9152c5dd17d18d6c2872aa04fb1464f38c20eaa93916ed",
      "text": "（说起来，这附近好像有喝剩下的水……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bea3e46491461abe882cf4d25c2d442c18f2b35f7a2101e31de887d3e7646f49",
      "text": "让您久等了，次郎先生。\n……哎，等等。桌上的玻璃杯里冒出了白色的气体。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06fcb363e80b247ad8445ab5263960f03af157caa617eb27a198862d9db3e0c3",
      "text": "难道说，里面放了干冰吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8694b4c84776fcd0bf693e435c00fd50a5a3ec78d013549e4760deada72992",
      "text": "嘿嘿，答对了。\n不过这个严格来说并不是气体，而是水哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:632b77e17faa2725eec2207493cf10dddb1c4eaf71623272773e711dfca2bc3b",
      "text": "因为干冰的温度非常低，\n低到甚至能把水给冻结成冰呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66de31fb53bca28121cc714d3bbdb82d8b91a489cc7075c6b752b840910cce0c",
      "text": "这种白色的气体，是杯子里的水\n被干冰冷却后的产物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67c8af0358cb788df53d3255fb5f952749cdfbd064651d9f4c861c6defd3bca7",
      "text": "也就是说，是细小的冰粒和水滴。\n以上就是大叔我的化学实验。开玩笑的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4b15238bec02ec7239c8581a76b5f3a8c7cc590771b835e9ca282a3dee19224",
      "text": "真不愧是化学老师呢。\n非常有意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:111354a9210fcaf155ae976a7e3e093cb39c1cea6736739543c974b6900205d7",
      "text": "虽说是“前”教师就是了。虽然大家总觉得化学晦涩难懂\n而敬而远之，但其实日常生活中到处都是呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b5974fa0b3f4b568dd5ca623e13d9c9766f8e0b817cf10c576618be3e375dfc",
      "text": "……其实我刚才看的，是一篇国外的化学论文啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f7b4e212f405ab168ccfaca92c0cd0662a5c7af6a1955f543a9f75340807e10",
      "text": "毕竟化学日新月异，经常会让人感叹“居然还能这样！”\n其实出乎意料地有趣哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db90c3981deeaa6052ca8990dc4739879c3782565d23e001db31448542de76d3",
      "text": "我自己有时候也会写写\n报告或者假说之类的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f5b67d974c59f9e1aee5f6e13a045b4d44c5e8e9507d9b85b8ab24098b07a39",
      "text": "啊，不，纯粹属于兴趣范围啦？\n完全没有打算投去哪里发表！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ee9c5fc543d954fad66be5f9b4a2925d69ed8eee7222b340bb8de9158eae0c",
      "text": "……原来如此。\n果然次郎先生是最合适的人选呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1283bea92b3d4ed0b07d3fa308c93041c596c5203111c24ffae1fce21f27d337",
      "text": "合适的人选？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c898dfb532ee916b4b25bc2dbd3fb44cd17c29552c1d1aaa6e2cc0e84a7e70db",
      "text": "刚才跟我商谈的对方，\n其实是某本科学杂志的相关人员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f78991079bef79c7128b26cb7e7a20554c52423ccf1873038c63e506decd169f",
      "text": "为了扩大读者群，他们发来了一份通告，\n希望能做一期化学家与偶像的对谈特辑……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5b13ef8edfe1bdc4f4defa823650e3667ac29a9110b762eb5e08c04058d7af4",
      "text": "我非常想推荐次郎先生去，\n您觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdde3c0783edecc53f6f3336cfd56ca7bc8fe36a2319faf9567a4e0f567ce390",
      "text": "哎……哎哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a002c02f1271656de72524ae16d69f23e8335bd381c3e8c5f8265b8b0c682b29",
      "text": "对谈当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08a1c29648bbb1b9e1469becbf7b2addbecfc7b963b1c494ef0e8ea1d5a4abc1",
      "text": "您好，今天天气真不错呢……嘿嘿，\n这种时候该怎么开场才好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d5189577414b1ad7701dfc20bb5836ba25ee1ad3b579c35f4ae6eea1c80a14f",
      "text": "总之，能见到您非常高兴。\n请多多关照，博士。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69887757850a4b2c54089ba90e259e1ae7c35b0e8698044b9f70f88d046d08f1",
      "text": "（……对谈似乎进行得很顺利）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12a7b34c66c9b5694f95503fcb720bac3df2d1e636b7b114c5551daea2f3fddc",
      "text": "（次郎先生的紧张感好像也消除了，\n看起来挺开心的呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000077:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de0f0cf015323005be4b6655a7cfd5f9643f3c88bd91cee2688f8a58eca75c3",
      "text": "……老实说，我心里更多的是在想\n“找我这种人真的好吗？”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2296395f136e63e118afd76e1013a017cb072863e8482a8f2b0abe6114936d01",
      "text": "我明白了。\n如果不嫌弃我的话，那份工作就让我接下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f740b3fd9cfa8e439844b81eb8997a1f6e2598032fa19da1f99c674fbb2c968c",
      "text": "虽然我觉得自己担子有点重就是了。\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2036625c43cabab4af4f142479847eb457f35004b3ffc4b626ccf792f4175ccd",
      "text": "既然●●●●プロデューサー酱说我是最合适的人选，\n那我就选择相信这句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1c32516222a8a793c423bc99bb6dac8d57bdac5cf76fdc87be0ab15f7fb5225",
      "text": "毕竟我一直都在受你的照顾嘛。\n该说是慧眼……吗？我很信赖你哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e4d64e0a140a0613bb5a7882aa590499cb585e1f9fc8b53e3151505ca415219",
      "text": "谢谢你愿意把这件事交托给我啊，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
